        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based strategy game about building a colony on Mars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of humanity’s expansion to Mars in this turn-based colony builder. Use each turn to deploy terraforming tools — reshape terrain, create mineral deposits, or enhance existing resources to support your growing colony. Build homes for settlers, construct vital infrastructure, and work toward a self-sustaining future on the Red Planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > BUILD MARS COLONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a sustainable habitat for your settlers by installing water pumps, cultivating fertile land, harnessing solar energy, and extracting valuable minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your layout carefully — building placement matters. Each structure grants adjacency bonuses that can make or break your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERRAFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn gives you the chance to alter the terrain with a terraforming kit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need water? Place a water drop tile in a canyon and watch the flatlands bloom.<br>Missing resources? Enrich the area by creating new mineral deposits or extending those already present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > SANDBOX &amp; SURVIVAL MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-changing worlds in <strong>sandbox mode</strong>, where each map and terraforming kit is procedurally generated for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or challenge yourself in <strong>survival mode</strong>, where each step brings more settlers and rising demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless growth… or inevitable collapse — how far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based strategy game about building a colony on Mars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of humanity’s expansion to Mars in this turn-based colony builder. Use each turn to deploy terraforming tools — reshape terrain, create mineral deposits, or enhance existing resources to support your growing colony. Build homes for settlers, construct vital infrastructure, and work toward a self-sustaining future on the Red Planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > BUILD MARS COLONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a sustainable habitat for your settlers by installing water pumps, cultivating fertile land, harnessing solar energy, and extracting valuable minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your layout carefully — building placement matters. Each structure grants adjacency bonuses that can make or break your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERRAFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn gives you the chance to alter the terrain with a terraforming kit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need water? Place a water drop tile in a canyon and watch the flatlands bloom.<br>Missing resources? Enrich the area by creating new mineral deposits or extending those already present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > SANDBOX &amp; SURVIVAL MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-changing worlds in <strong>sandbox mode</strong>, where each map and terraforming kit is procedurally generated for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or challenge yourself in <strong>survival mode</strong>, where each step brings more settlers and rising demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless growth… or inevitable collapse — how far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
